{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution. The amount of this contribution is fixed in the annex of the charter[[cite:obs-04536c869fd6462ccc0df9bad7da394a689af0d9 \"Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.\"]].\n\nAccording to the annex, the ordinary contribution is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January[[cite:obs-86f482fa3f2422e0889f8aec0e2e563c54dc567a \"Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added statements about the membership fee and yearly amount paid by members, each supported by exact citations from the charter and annex sources as requested."}